<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-022" chapter-id="c-nanshi-022-wangjian-sihui" source-id="s-nanshi-022-wangjian-sihui-ws1477957">
  <p id="c-nanshi-022-wangjian-sihui:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangjian-sihui:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAB">暕</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangjian-sihui:p001:m0002" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAB">思晦</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangjian-sihui:p001:m0005" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAA">騫</persName>弟也。年數歲而風神警拔，有成人之度。時父<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangjian-sihui:p001:m0026" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA">儉</persName>作宰相，<rs id="c-nanshi-022-wangjian-sihui:p001:u0031" type="unresolved">賓客</rs>盈門，見<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangjian-sihui:p001:m0037" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAB">暕</persName>曰：「公才公望，復在此矣。」弱冠選尚淮南長公主，拜駙馬都尉，曆秘書丞。齊明帝詔求異士，始安王<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangjian-sihui:p001:m0084" ref="98q_mll_d6v_AA">遙光</persName>薦<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangjian-sihui:p001:m0087" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAB">暕</persName>及東海<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangjian-sihui:p001:m0091" ref="59d_72d_924_AAA">王僧孺</persName>。除<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangjian-sihui:p001:m0096" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAB">暕</persName>驃騎從事中郎，天監中，歷位侍中，吏部尚書，領國子祭酒。門貴，與物隔，不能留心<rs id="c-nanshi-022-wangjian-sihui:p001:u0135" type="unresolved">寒素</rs>，頗稱刻薄。後為尚書左僕射，領國子祭酒。卒，諡曰靖。子<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangjian-sihui:p001:m0164" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAABA">承</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangjian-sihui:p001:m0166" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAABB">幼</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangjian-sihui:p001:m0168" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAABC">訓</persName>，並通顯。</p>
</text>
